<title>FRANCE: Havas capital to be increased to 14 bln ffr. [CORRECTED 22:50 GMT]</title>
<headline>Havas capital to be increased to 14 bln ffr. [CORRECTED 22:50 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects headline and text to show increase is from 12 to 14 bln and not by 12 to 14 bln.)</p>
<p>The share capital of Havas will be increased from 12 to 14 billion francs due to a capital increase for the higher stake by Generale des Eaux, Havas Finance Director Nicolas Duhamel said on Thursday.</p>
</text>
